    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like \"grief\" anymore. it just feels like... being unfinished. like i'm a half-empty vessel. without him, there's no point to any of this. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person looking back. i'm just a shadow of what we were together.",
